      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Just as a sord of P.S. Dear Friends \"The O'Donnells\". \"The more hurry the less speed\", the old say- ing could easily be applied to the other side of theis \"document\". I guess it hardly pays for an apprentice to speed up too much. Any how I thought you'd be pleased to know that I received quite an appreciative letter from M.C.C. I think what \"raised his fethers\" about my letter before, was my having quoted you as intimating that his heart-attack had possily left him ? not exactly himself. But really that feature just amused me. Otherwise it was a nice letter and quite indicative of a charitable feeling to the O'Donnells.",
      "per_polygon": "Just as a sord of P.S. Dear Friends \"The O'Donnells\". \"The more hurry the less speed\", the old say- ing could easily be applied to the other side of theis \"document\". I guess it hardly pays for an apprentice to speed up too much. Any how I thought you'd be pleased to know that I received quite an appreciative letter from M.C.C. I think what \"raised his fethers\" about my letter before, was my having quoted you as intimating that his heart-attack had possily left him ? not exactly himself. But really that feature just amused me. Otherwise it was a nice letter and quite indicative of a charitable feeling to the O'Donnells.",
